  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "In a large skillet, cook the butter over medium heat until melted.",
    "Add the ginger, green chilies, and casserole seasoning. Cook for 1-2 minutes.",
    "Stir in the fish sauce, soy sauce, and brown sugar. Cook for an additional minute.",
    "Add the barley to the skillet and stir to combine. Cook for 2-3 minutes.",
    "Stir in the coconut milk and bring to a simmer.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a 9x13-inch baking dish and smooth the top.",
    "Drizzle with sesame oil and cover with aluminum foil.",
    "Bake for 30 minutes, then remove the foil and continue baking for an additional 10-15 minutes.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy!"
